    <version>1.101.0</version>
    <time>1789573456</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 1.101.0i fix bsc#1278303 (CVE-2026-84377):
  * New core runtime dependencies:
    - python-boto3 &gt;= 1.43.1 (new in 1.101.0, non-optional)
    - python-pydantic-settings &gt;= 2.14.1
  * Bumped runtime floors to match the 1.101.0   
  * 1.101.0 switched the PEP 517 backend to maturin to build a new Rust
    extension (litellm.rust_bridge._native) which is opt-in.
    keep the pure-Python noarch wheel and build it with uv_build</comment>
    <requestid>1378206</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="3" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>b097c44adc3551d1023e26849c71a463</srcmd5>
    <version>1.103.0</version>
    <time>1790697309</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 1.103.0:
  * Also includes the 1.102.0 and 1.102.1 fixes CVE-2026-93355
    (bsc#1283059) and bsc#1282835 (CVE-2026-89032)
  * New provider support: xAI speech-to-text (Grok Voice
    Transcribe), Vertex AI Chirp streaming over /v1/realtime,
    Deepgram WebSocket passthrough with duration-based cost
    tracking, Amazon Transcribe pass-through with completion-time
    job pricing
  * Proxy: Claude Code gateway protocol under
    /claude_code_gateway, NVIDIA NIM object detection and OCR
    passthrough, RFC 8693 token exchange for IdP JWTs on the
    gateway token endpoint, batched user and team membership
    creation (POST /management/v1/users/bulk)
  * Router: capability classifier after Fuse V2 forecasting;
    re-check budget on router fallback targets (behaviour change)
  * MCP: require admission for delegated OAuth
  * Guardrails: stream Prompt Security post_call redactions in
    incremental_diff mode
  * Rust bridge: scaffold Redis cache crate, extract auth and
    cache crates (still opt-in via LITELLM_RUST)
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release
    notes for the full list (forwarded request 1381485 from mslacken)</comment>
    <requestid>1381486</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
